  "_note": "cue -> [pack:file] sources and a mix gain. Every pack is CC0 (URLs below). Rebuild with: python3 -I tools/sfx/build.py pack=dir [pack=dir ...]. v1 (2026-10-11) was all 8-bit synth samples and read as sci-fi lasers; v2 (2026-10-12) uses recorded fantasy foley processed to a 16-bit-era sampler sound, keeping only the chiptune fanfares. v3 (same day): spell casts were sparkle chimes and read as a child's toy; casts are now pitched-down swing whooshes, impacts cracks/slams/thuds, and every spell landing gets a low spell_thud underneath. `rate` is a playback pitch applied at play time (0.7 = deeper). v4 (same day): the swing whooshes still carried a blade ring and read as sword hits; casts are now real air swooshes and flame whooshes, fire lands as a fireball, frost as ice, arcane/nature as an earth-magic rumble.",
